  "_comment": "Negative. A structurally complete change event that also carries rkaf:assertionPolarity. A proposal cannot carry polarity: recording a proposed removal as a denial says the relation was never true and erases the difference every later comparison depends on. Caught by rkaf:RelationChangeEventNoPolarityShape, since the open-world compiled carriers ignore a property the CUE shape merely omits."
